'''Bloody Waves''' are the result of [[Wave (Tombs of Amascut)|waves]] washing over the blood splatters near the edges for the first waves at the start of the fight, or temporary splatters of blood that are left behind when players are suffering from [[Zebak]]'s bleed effect.

